  "plan": {
    "generalPlan": "NOTA DE REFERENCIA (Para Urología / Nefrología)\n\nFICHA DE REFERENCIA MÉDICA\nFecha: 18 de Mayo de 2026\nPaciente: Jennifer Thalia López Sánchez\nEdad: 30 años | Sexo: Femenino\nServicio Solicitado: Urología / Nefrología\n\nMotivo de envío: Valoración por hallazgo de quiste renal complejo vascularizado y probable Enfermedad Renal Poliquística Autosómica Dominante (ERPAD).\n\nResumen Clínico:\nPaciente femenina de 30 años, asintomática, que acude para seguimiento ultrasonográfico. En USG de abdomen superior (Nov 2025) se reporta esteatosis hepática leve y múltiples quistes hepáticos. A nivel renal, se observa nefromegalia bilateral a expensas de múltiples imágenes quísticas con pérdida de la relación cortico-medular. Destaca en riñón derecho un quiste complejo en polo superior con pared delgada y septos incompletos vascularizados a la aplicación de Doppler color.\n\nLaboratorios relevantes (Nov 2025):\n\nQuímica Sanguínea: Creatinina 0.61 mg/dL, BUN 10.9 mg/dL, Glucosa 108.7 mg/dL, Ácido Úrico 4.6.\n\nHbA1c: 5.8% (Prediabetes).\n\nPFH: AST 30.1, ALT 44.4.\n\nEGO: Normal, sin hematuria ni proteinuria. Gravedad específica 1.014.\n\nPlan sugerido:\nSe envía para abordaje diagnóstico del quiste complejo derecho (estadificación Bosniak), manejo especializado de probable enfermedad poliquística y seguimiento.",
    "nonPharmacological": "<p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 18px; color: rgb(43, 45, 49); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">1. Hidratación (Clave para riñones poliquísticos):</strong></p><ul _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"padding-left: 24px; color: rgb(43, 45, 49); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><li><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 45, 49); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Beber de </span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 45, 49); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">2.5 a 3 litros de agua natural al día</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(43, 45, 49); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">. Mantener la orina de un color amarillo muy pálido ayuda a suprimir la hormona vasopresina, lo que científicamente ralentiza el crecimiento de los quistes renales.</span></li><li><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">2. Reducción de Sodio (Sal):</strong></li><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><li _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-optical-sizing: auto; line-height: 21px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"line-height: 21px; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 7px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">No agregar sal extra a las comidas en la mesa.</span></ms-cmark-node></p></ms-cmark-node></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-optical-sizing: auto; line-height: 21px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"line-height: 21px; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 7px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Evitar alimentos ultraprocesados, embutidos (salchichas, jamón, tocino), enlatados, sopas instantáneas y consomés en polvo (Knorr Suiza).</span></ms-cmark-node></p></ms-cmark-node></li></ms-cmark-node></ul><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 18px; color: rgb(43, 45, 49); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">3. Para revertir la Prediabetes y Hígado Graso:</strong></ms-cmark-node></p><ul _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"padding-left: 24px; color: rgb(43, 45, 49); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><li _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-optical-sizing: auto; line-height: 21px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"line-height: 21px; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 7px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Cero azúcares añadidos:</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"> Evitar pan dulce, galletas, dulces, pasteles.</span></ms-cmark-node></p></ms-cmark-node></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-optical-sizing: auto; line-height: 21px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"line-height: 21px; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 7px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Carbohidratos complejos:</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"> Cambiar el pan blanco y las harinas refinadas por tortillas de maíz (porción moderada), avena natural, quinoa o arroz integral.</span></ms-cmark-node></p></ms-cmark-node></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-optical-sizing: auto; line-height: 21px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"line-height: 21px; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 7px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Aumentar la fibra:</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"> Incluir abundantes verduras verdes (espinaca, brócoli, calabaza, chayote) en el desayuno, comida y cena.</span></ms-cmark-node></p></ms-cmark-node></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-optical-sizing: auto; line-height: 21px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"line-height: 21px; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 7px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Proteínas limpias:</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"> Pollo sin piel, pescado, pavo, cortes de carne de res magra (sin grasa), huevo y leguminosas (frijoles, lentejas). No exceder el consumo de proteína (comer porciones del tamaño de la palma de la mano), ya que el exceso hace trabajar más al riñón.</span></ms-cmark-node></p></ms-cmark-node></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-optical-sizing: auto; line-height: 21px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"line-height: 21px; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 7px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Grasas saludables (Para subir el colesterol \"bueno\" HDL):</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"> Aguacate, aceite de oliva (en crudo), un puñado de almendras o nueces al día.</span></ms-cmark-node></p></ms-cmark-node></li></ms-cmark-node></ul><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 18px; color: rgb(43, 45, 49); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">4. Ejercicio:</strong></ms-cmark-node></p><ul _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"padding-left: 24px; color: rgb(43, 45, 49); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><li _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-optical-sizing: auto; line-height: 21px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"line-height: 21px; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 7px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Realizar ejercicio cardiovascular de intensidad moderada (caminata rápida, natación, elíptica) de </span><strong _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">30 a 45 minutos al día, 5 días a la semana</strong><span _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\">. Esto revertirá el hígado graso y mejorará la sensibilidad a la insulina.</span></ms-cmark-node></p></ms-cmark-node></li><li _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"font-optical-sizing: auto; line-height: 21px;\"><ms-cmark-node _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" _nghost-ng-c415364509=\"\" style=\"display: contents;\"><p _ngcontent-ng-c415364509=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" style=\"line-height: 21px; font-optical-sizing: auto; margin-bottom: 7px;\"><br></p></ms-cmark-node></li></ms-cmark-node></ul>",
